{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"十誦比丘戒本羯磨校勘說明","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"一.是書校歴三週．一譯校．二類校．三刻校。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"二.戒本譯校凡用二種異本。（一）姚秦弗若多羅等譯十誦律〈初三誦〉牒文．校註略","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"稱律本。（二）姚秦竺佛念譯鼻奈耶(因緣經)牒文．〈道安序謂與曇摩持譯十誦文合〉略","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"稱經本。別有誤題宋佛陀什譯五分戒本．燉煌出土失題比丘戒本．〈德祐寫本〉皆從","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"十誦撰出．文難依信．故不具勘。","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"三.戒本譯校凡有三例。（一）異本文歧有涉開製者．皆註出曰．某本雲雲。（二）異本","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"次第具缺不同者．亦註出曰．某本雲雲。（三）異本譯義較暢者．亦註出曰．勘某本","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"意雲雲。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"四.戒本類校凡用三本。（一）唐義淨新譯根本說一切有部戒經．校註略稱有部本。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"（二）梵文本比丘別解脫經．略稱梵本。（三）藏文本勝友等譯說一切有部別解","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"脫經．略稱藏本。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"五.戒本類校凡有二例。（一）各本文句歧異有關開製者．皆註出曰．某本雲雲。（二）","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"各本次第具缺不同者．亦註出曰．某本雲雲。其衆學處一類．各本出入甚大．另附","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"類勘表於末備考．文中不註。","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"六.羯磨無譯校．其類校凡用二本。（一）失譯〈附宋錄〉大沙門百一羯磨法．校註略稱","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"舊本。（二）唐義淨譯根本說一切有部百一羯磨．略稱新本。","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"七.羯磨類校凡有三例。（一）異本作法有別者．皆註出曰．某本雲雲。（二）因對勘而","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"刊正今誤者．亦註出曰．勘某本雲雲。（三）異本附註有可備考者．亦錄出曰．某本","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"註雲雲。","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"八.戒本羯磨刻校皆用南宋刻爲底本．對勘麗刻訂正文字．附註曰．原刻雲雲．依麗","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"刻雲雲。","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"九.今刊款式略有改動．以醒眉目。（一）戒本學處舊皆連寫．今逐戒另行．並記序數。","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"（二）羯磨原刻文字凌亂．今均釐正。","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"十.本書校勘資料出處如次。","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"（一）秦譯十誦律.日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本。","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"（二）秦譯鼻奈耶.同上。","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"（三）唐譯根本說一切有部戒經.同上。","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"（四）梵文本別解脫經.Pra^timoks!a-su^tra.斐諾氏L.Finot校刊.載一九一三","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"年法國亞細亞協會會報Journalasiatique,pp.465-558內。","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"（五）藏文本別解脫經．so-sorthar-bah!imdo.奈旦版甘珠．戒律部Ｃa字函一","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"頁至三十頁下。","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"（六）失譯大沙門百一羯磨法.日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本。","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"（七）唐譯根本說一切有部百一羯磨.同上。","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"（八）本書南宋刻及麗刻.悉依日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本及大正大藏經本","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_100_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_100","text":"校註。","sortOrder":38}],"overrides":{}}